      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAKE A BREAK (4) jumped from this box and placed in a Grade 5 at this track over 401m last time, finishing a neck from the winner (22.66). Has a strong record off this same draw including three wins. Has the ability and expected to go close. RAPID RITA (1) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PSYCHO CIRCUS (3) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (29.99) at this track in a NG. Rates a winning chance on best. NEW SURPRISE (2) led and held on to fill a placing last start - in the mix again.",
